<title>FINLAND: Tamro Jan-Feb sales up one pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Tamro Jan-Feb sales up one pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish pharmaceuticals wholesaler Oy Tamro Ab said in a statement on Thursday its sales increased one percent year-on-year in January-February to 2.01 billion markka.</p>
</text>
